        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 55%, transparent);">
          Inspection scope is determined by customer specification and part criticality. High-volume production typically follows AQL-based sampling (ANSI/ASQ Z1.4) with CMM verification at defined intervals. Critical aerospace and medical components receive <strong style="color: var(--theme-text);">100% dimensional inspection</strong> with full CMM reports. First-article inspection (FAI) per AS9102 is standard for all new programs. Surface roughness, NDT, and material certification are added per engineering requirements.
